{"id":"n59467-2-7","stage":2,"title":"뛰어들다 · 跳入","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59467-2-7-1","ko":"지수가 다리 위에서 한강으로 뛰어들었대.","zh":"据说智秀从桥上跳进了汉江里。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"다리","meaning":"桥，桥梁","explanation":"다리：桥，桥梁。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28826","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}},{"text":"위에서","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에서","audio":"/audio/cfcc067b42f049977fe6.mp3"}},{"text":"한강으로","meaning":"汉江","explanation":"한강：汉江；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"한강으로","audio":"/audio/30ba016c0ac41862e9a4.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한강으로","audio":"/audio/30ba016c0ac41862e9a4.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어들었대.","meaning":"跳入，跳进","explanation":"뛰어들다：跳入，跳进；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어들다","audio":"/audio/bd1f0cce39e2da6199b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59467","senseId":"2","lemma":"뛰어들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어들었대","audio":"/audio/c212ee6cbaa020197de2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"桥，桥梁","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"28826","definition":"为使越过河流、大海、道路，山谷等而连接两边建造的设施。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"比某基准更高的一方；或指比中间更高的一方。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"bd1f