难，困难；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"4","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들었나","audio":"/audio/791f29fbfc1177df8223.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"e39300a264725a21","term":"어떡하다","zh":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/e39300a264725a21172c.mp3","entryId":"70480","definition":"“어떠하게 하다(怎么办)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"73f381e31e823f6e","term":"죽음","zh":"死亡","audio":"/audio/73f381e31e823f6e43a9.mp3","entryId":"62454","definition":"失去生命，或指其失去生命的状态。","pronunciation":["주금"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"艰难，困难","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"状况或情况等不宽裕，难。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e85532321ed9992768b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.693,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=59467","lab